---
const points = ['Bulk billing available', 'Online appointments', 'Telehealth consultations', 'Interpreter services'];
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 gradient-bg-soft fade-on-scroll">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Morley General Practice clinic interior" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-72 sm:h-96 object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-4 sm:-right-8 gradient-bg text-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-5 max-w-[180px]">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black">New</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-medium text-white/85">Modern clinic, accepting new patients now</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="inline-block gradient-text text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">About Us</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Dedicated to Your <span class="gradient-text">Whole-Person Health</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Morley General Practice is a modern, patient-centred medical centre proudly serving the Morley community and surrounding northern suburbs of Perth. Our dedicated team of experienced GPs and support staff are committed to delivering exceptional, holistic healthcare from day one.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        We partner with our sister clinic, Yokine Medical Centre, to provide seamless care across two convenient Perth locations — both owned and operated by the same dedicated medical team.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
        {points.map((text) => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full gradient-bg text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0"><i class="ri-check-line"></i></span>
            <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">{text}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="gradient-bg text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-200 inline-block">
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
